---
sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Usuário (WhatsApp)
    participant Meta as WhatsApp Cloud API
    participant Server as Servidor (Backend)
    participant Gladia as Gladia API (STT)
    participant Mistral as Mistral AI (LLM)
    participant Murf as Murf.ai (TTS)

    Note over User,Server: PARTE 1: Fluxo de Mensagem de Texto
    User->>Meta: 1. Envia mensagem de texto
    Meta-->>Server: Webhook: 2. POST /webhook (from, message_id, type="text", text.body)
    Note right of Server: 3. Extrai: numero from, conteudo do texto
    Note right of Server: 4. Processa texto (logica generic/resposta)
    Server->>Meta: 5. POST /v24.0/{PHONE_NUMBER_ID}/messages (to, type="text", text.body - resposta generica)
    Meta-->>User: 6. Entrega mensagem de texto ao Usuario

    Note over User,Server: PARTE 2: Fluxo de Mensagem de Áudio
    Note over User,Server: 2.1 Receber Áudio
    Server->>Meta: 7. Envia mensagem de áudio
    Meta-->>Server: Webhook: 8. POST /webhook (from, message_id, type="audio", audio.id - MEDIA_ID)
    Note right of Server: 9. Extrai: numero from, MEDIA_ID
    Server->>Meta: 10. GET /media/{MEDIA_ID} (phone_number_id, Bearer token)
    Meta-->>Server: 11. JSON com audio_url temporaria (valida 5 min)
    Note right of Server: URL válida por 5 minutos

    Server->>Meta: 12. GET {audio_url}
    Meta-->>Server: 13. Arquivo binario de audio (.ogg)
    Note right of Server: 14. Salva arquivo de audio localmente

    Note over Server,Gladia: 2.3: Speech-to-Text (Gladia - 3 passos)
    Server->>Gladia: 15. POST /v2/upload (arquivo de audio, multipart/form-data, Bearer token)
    Gladia-->>Server: 16. JSON com audio_url (URL interna do Gladia)
    Server->>Gladia: 17. POST /v2/pre-recorded (audio_url, language_config, Bearer token)
    Gladia-->>Server: 18. JSON com transcription_id
    Note right of Server: Inicia transcrição
    Server->>Gladia: 19. GET /v2/pre-recorded/{transcription_id} (polling, Bearer token)
    
    loop Polling until status=done
    Gladia-->>Server: 20. JSON com status "queued" ou "done", full_transcript (quando done)
    Note right of Gladia: Status queued to done
    end

    Note right of Server: Extrai: texto full_transcript

    Note over Server,Mistral: 2.4: Processamento LLM (Mistral AI)
    Server->>Mistral: 22. POST /v1/conversations/start (agent_id, inputs: full_transcript, Bearer token)
    Note right of Mistral: 23. Processa com configuracao do agente e LLM
    Mistral-->>Server: 24. JSON com conversation_id, outputs[0].content (texto de resposta), usage (tokens)
    Note right of Server: 25. Extrai: conversation_id, texto de resposta
    
    Note over Server,Murf: 2.5 Text-to-Speech (Murf.ai)
    Server->>Murf: 26. POST /v1/speech/generate (text: resposta do Mistral, voice_id, style, format="OGG", Bearer token)
    Note right of Murf: 27. Sintetiza audio
    Murf-->>Server: 28. JSON com audioFile (URL valida 72h), audioLengthInSeconds, encodedAudio (opcional Base64)
    Note right of Server: URL valida por 72 horas
    Note right of Server: 29. Baixa audio de audioFile URL ou decodifica Base64

    Note over Server,Meta: 2.6: Enviar Resposta de Audio
    Server->>Meta: 30. POST /v24.0/{PHONE_NUMBER_ID}/media (arquivo de audio, multipart/form-data, type="audio/ogg codecs opus", Bearer token)
    Meta-->>Server: 31. JSON com MEDIA_ID (audio de resposta)
    Server->>Meta: 32. POST /v24.0/{PHONE_NUMBER_ID}/messages (to: numero do usuario, type="audio", audio.id: MEDIA_ID, audio.voice=true, Bearer token)
    Meta-->>User: 33. Entrega mensagem de audio ao Usuario
    
    Note over User,Murf: Operacoes assincronas destacadas: polling, downloads